message: >-
  If you use MettleQ, please cite this software and identify the exact version,
  commit, backend, hardware, precision, and result contract used.
title: MettleQ
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-07-19
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Sharma
    given-names: Monit
repository-code: https://github.com/MonitSharma/MettleQ
url: https://github.com/MonitSharma/MettleQ
abstract: >-
  A trustworthy local quantum-circuit simulation engine for Apple Silicon,
  with Qiskit and PennyLane adapters, exact statevector and bounded MPS methods,
  MLX and custom Metal execution, memory preflight, and reproducible evidence.
keywords:
  - quantum simulation
  - Apple Silicon
  - Metal
  - MLX
  - Qiskit
  - PennyLane
